# Shady Business (bastok 8): Talib in Port Bastok. The Beauty and the Galka guard, the event 90 begin only while
# available, the zinc trade (four chunks, not three), the completion repeated: the section holds once Beauty and the
# Galka is completed, and its trade answers only while the quest is accepted or completed (user ruling 2026-11-05, kept
# bugs: the Lua's trade also answered while available; #unaccepted).
lists PortBastok/Talib/onTrigger PortBastok/Talib/onTrade PortBastok/onEventFinish/90 PortBastok/onEventFinish/91
char zone=PortBastok pos=-100,4.649,28.8
item ChunkOfZincOre x11
login
trigger Talib                   # Beauty and the Galka not completed: its offer 2, not 90
finish-if-event                 # Beauty and the Galka accepted
quest Bastok.BeautyAndTheGalka completed
trigger Talib                   # 90
finish                          # available: accepted
trigger Talib                   # 90 again
finish                          # accepted: no change
trade Talib ChunkOfZincOre x3   # three chunks: nothing
trade Talib ChunkOfZincOre x4   # 91
finish                          # completed: 350 gil, Norg fame 30, four chunks gone
trigger Talib                   # completed: 90 still
finish                          # completed: not accepted again
trade Talib ChunkOfZincOre x4   # completed: 91 again
finish                          # the repeat: 350 gil, Norg fame 30 again
